    narr:narration """This narrative holds a single position: [markdown timing that keeps discounted goods reachable and priced visibly before purchase](narr:Position_MarkdownTimingVisibility). Its witness examples — [day-old loaves at half price from two in the afternoon rather than at close](narr:Position_MarkdownTimingVisibility), with [the shelf card changing at the same hour](narr:Position_MarkdownTimingVisibility) — frame the question of whom a price-change schedule serves.""" ;
